🇬🇧 English

⚡ Who Am I?

I'm Higer — an independent developer from Dörverden, Lower Saxony, Germany.

I work on open-source projects that combine:

💻 Software
   ↓
🌐 Web Applications
   ↓
⚙️ Automation
   ↓
🔌 IoT
   ↓
🔧 Hardware
   ↓
🌍 Real-world Projects

I don't want my projects to live only on my computer.

I want people to be able to see them, use them, learn from them, modify them and build something even better.

Everything possible is developed openly and shared through GitHub.

---

